
== U1-CMD-1 sv: Commander at the lead; the foes' Opportunist and Mirror Herb copy
  p1a Tatsugiri [0] item=- ability=commander v:commanding
  p1b Dondozo [atk+2 def+2 spa+2 spd+2 spe+2] item=- ability=oblivious v:commanded
  p2a Espathra [atk+2 def+2 spa+2 spd+2 spe+2] item=- ability=opportunist v:
  p2b Kingambit [atk+2 def+2 spa+2 spd+2 spe+2] item=- ability=defiant v:
  |-activate|p1a: Tatsugiri|ability: Commander|[of] p1b: Dondozo
  |-boost|p1b: Dondozo|atk|2
  |-boost|p1b: Dondozo|spa|2
  |-boost|p1b: Dondozo|spe|2
  |-boost|p1b: Dondozo|def|2
  |-boost|p1b: Dondozo|spd|2
  |-ability|p2a: Espathra|Opportunist|boost
  |-boost|p2a: Espathra|atk|2
  |-boost|p2a: Espathra|spa|2
  |-boost|p2a: Espathra|spe|2
  |-boost|p2a: Espathra|def|2
  |-boost|p2a: Espathra|spd|2
  |-enditem|p2b: Kingambit|Mirror Herb
  |-boost|p2b: Kingambit|atk|2|[from] item: Mirror Herb
  |-boost|p2b: Kingambit|spa|2|[from] item: Mirror Herb
  |-boost|p2b: Kingambit|spe|2|[from] item: Mirror Herb
  |-boost|p2b: Kingambit|def|2|[from] item: Mirror Herb
  |-boost|p2b: Kingambit|spd|2|[from] item: Mirror Herb

