== U1-TRC-1 sv: Trace copies Intimidate from two Intimidate foes
  p1a Gardevoir [atk-2] item=- ability=intimidate v:
  p1b Snorlax [atk-2] item=- ability=thickfat v:
  p2a Incineroar [atk-1] item=- ability=intimidate v:
  p2b Gyarados [atk-1] item=- ability=intimidate v:
  |-ability|p2b: Gyarados|Intimidate|boost
  |-unboost|p1a: Gardevoir|atk|1
  |-unboost|p1b: Snorlax|atk|1
  |-ability|p1a: Gardevoir|Intimidate|Trace|[from] ability: Trace|[of] p2a: Incineroar
  |-ability|p1a: Gardevoir|Intimidate|boost
  |-unboost|p2a: Incineroar|atk|1
  |-unboost|p2b: Gyarados|atk|1
  |-ability|p2a: Incineroar|Intimidate|boost
  |-unboost|p1a: Gardevoir|atk|1
  |-unboost|p1b: Snorlax|atk|1

